						<xs:documentation>DIUM stations - Places of acceptance/delivery	Station open into international traffic of goods (tariff point included in DIUM) – consignment acceptance/delivery station (loading points are excluded and covered by TypeCode 37). </xs:documentation>
					</xs:annotation>
				</xs:enumeration>
				<xs:enumeration value="43">
					<xs:annotation>
						<xs:documentation>Passengers cars public loading	Is a type of physical location on the open access network where passengers can put their car on a carrying train </xs:documentation>
					</xs:annotation>
				</xs:enumeration>
				<xs:enumeration value="45">
